indow thread could fall asleep with it pending); macOS and Wayland keep rendering on the main thread (window::supports_gl_thread - GLFW changes the NSOpenGL context / the surface there without locking it); the logic takes the input at the trade in the synced op (fresher); the window thread collects again right after applying requests (a new size reaches the game at once), applies them only on a change, a focus change or every 100 ms, and requests are copied only on a change; an error of the rendering loop lets the logic out of wait_swap (abort), so the exit no longer hangs before the error is logged; the clipboard is read outside its mutex and before the activation is counted (atomic); an ensure touches the cursor only on the window's thread; the editor's cursor warp uses the frame's screen size; draw_non_menu_cursor uses the frame's own should_pause_cursor; window::set(vsync) private.","ai_tool":"Claude"},{"repo_name":"alexpfau/calendar-card-pro","commit_timestamp":"2026-10-31T19:37:39Z","branch":"main","commit_sha":"ffc43f53c0fbd60935b659efaaec62695aa25941","github_link":"https://github.com/alexpfau/calendar-card-pro/commit/ffc43f53c0fbd60935b659efaaec62695aa25941","commit_subject":"docs(release): link Smart-Live's v5 video","ai_tool":"Copilot"},{"repo_name":"domainaware/parsedmarc","commit_timestamp":"2026-10-31T19:37:37Z","branch":"master","commit_sha":"56e5a099239116b1f0a423ec83589445692ee162","github_link":"https://github.com/domainaware/parsedmarc/commit/56e5a099239116b1f0a423ec83589445692ee162","commit_subject":"Add opt-in Elasticsearch/OpenSearch data streams (#937)","ai_tool":"Claude"},{"repo_name":"langwatch/langwatch","commit_timestamp":"2026-10-31T19:36:14Z","branch":"main","commit_sha":"252263af272827d94c2e31b85348f581bc52232f","github_link":"https://github.com/langwatch/langwatch/commit/252263af272827d94c2e31b85348f581bc52232f","commit_subject":"feat(instant-eval-judge): judge router behind release_instant_evals_judge_router (#9118)","ai_tool":"Claude